{"id":"n41125-2-7","stage":5,"title":"내지르다 · 击","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41125-2-7-1","ko":"손은 어쩌다가 다친 거야?","zh":"手是怎么受伤的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손은","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손은","audio":"/audio/da333238fde4c8dd7241.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩌다가","meaning":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다가：“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다가","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91976","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌다가","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3"}},{"text":"다친","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다친","audio":"/audio/634eef482edb9bba8180.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"f173c7431a0ab9ee","term":"어쩌다가","zh":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/f173c7431a0ab9eefb87.mp3","entryId":"91976","definition":"“어찌하다가(不知怎的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/2c098aa246f864965f7a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41125-2-7-2","ko":"어제 너무 화가 나서 주먹으로 창문을 내질러 버렸어.","zh":"昨天我太生气了，一拳把窗户砸坏了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"화가","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화가","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3"}},{"text":"나서","meaning":"发火（화가 나다）","explanation":"나다：发火（화가 나다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나서","audio":"/audio/3e57ffe9f50d4fca37a8.mp3"}},{"text":"주먹으로","meaning":"拳头","explanation":"주먹：拳头；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"주먹","audio":"/audio/185cb776662b98cf534c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79399","senseId":"1","lemma":"주먹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주먹으로","audio":"/audio/d359199002c9d5678a6e.mp3"}},{"text":"창문을","meaning":"窗，窗户","explanation":"창문：窗，窗户；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"창문","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71809","senseId":"1","lemma":"창문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창문을","audio":"/audio/7c25284c1cbad752179c.mp3"}},{"text":"내질러","meaning":"击，踢，刺","explanation":"내지르다：击，踢，刺；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"내지르다","audio":"/audio/c2a6f26bd524f44481e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41125","senseId":"2","lemma":"내지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내질러","audio":"/audio/e2c2ef510aaa275093ae.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어","audio":"/audio/fe1d7a5ead4341d8e790.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"950afe85bf406364","term":"화","zh":"火，气","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3","entryId":"74134","definition":"十分不满意或恼怒的情绪。","pronunciation":["화ː"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发火（화가 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"发火（화가 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"185cb776662b98cf","term":"주먹","zh":"拳头","audio":"/audio/185cb776662b98cf534c.mp3","entryId":"79399","definition":"卷屈所有手指而握住的手。","pronunciation":["주먹"]},{"id":"13938495269cab67","term":"창문","zh":"窗，窗户","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3","entryId":"71809","definition":"做在墙壁或屋顶上的、用来通风或采光的门。","pronu